    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1729779207371\" id=\"item-671a5511c23b8b3227551bb5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-63509f3c4260efa8edaf\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pinnacle Niseko Property: A Real Estate Gem in Hokkaido, Japan</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    \n      \n    \n    <div\n      class=\"embed-block-wrapper\"\n      style=\"padding-bottom:56.49999999999999%;\"\n    >\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-video-wrapper\"\n        data-provider-name=\"YouTube\"\n        data-html=\"&lt;iframe width=&quot;200&quot; height=&quot;113&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/zp2Ypx8r_kA?feature=oembed&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allow=&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot; allowfullscreen title=&quot;Pinnacle Niseko | Property Media Japan&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"\n        data-localized=\"{&quot;invalidVideo&quot;:&quot;Invalid video embed.&quot;,&quot;playButton&quot;:&quot;Play&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n      >\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58903 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_58990\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Discover the Land of Pinnacle Niseko</h3>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_59894\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">About us:<br>Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729778505570_59997\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nestled in the serene and picturesque landscapes of Hokkaido, Pinnacle Niseko offers a unique opportunity to build your sanctuary amidst one of Japan's most awe-inspiring natural settings. Located just outside the world-renowned ski resort of Niseko, this prime piece of land invites future homeowners to embrace nature and enjoy spectacular views of Mount Yotei and Mount Annupuri.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">As you venture down a tree-lined road, scattered leaves underfoot and surrounded by the colors of ever-changing seasons, you are immediately captivated by the beauty and tranquility that define Pinnacle Niseko. The landscape offers a perfect canvas to design and build a retreat that harmonizes with nature, allowing you to fully embrace the rhythms of the natural world\u2014whether it\u2019s the crisp air of winter or the fresh bloom of spring.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Embrace the Beauty of Niseko\u2019s Natural Wonders</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Pinnacle Niseko property offers more than just a piece of land\u2014it offers a lifestyle centered around peace, serenity, and the majesty of Hokkaido\u2019s stunning landscapes. Imagine waking up every morning to panoramic views of the iconic Mount Yotei, often referred to as the \"Mount Fuji of the North.\" The vibrant hues of the surrounding forest provide a constantly shifting tapestry of color, creating a truly immersive experience for homeowners.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Every day in this serene location feels like a retreat, offering you the chance to slow down, breathe in the fresh mountain air, and experience the quiet beauty that defines Niseko. Whether you're a winter sports enthusiast or someone seeking a peaceful summer getaway, this property offers endless possibilities.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Build Your Dream Sanctuary</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Pinnacle Niseko land is ideal for building a custom home that takes advantage of the area\u2019s scenic vistas and pristine environment. Whether it\u2019s a modern architectural masterpiece or a cozy traditional chalet, your vision can come to life in a place where nature and luxury coexist.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Niseko has long been favored by both international and domestic property investors, and the area continues to grow in popularity due to its renowned ski resorts and breathtaking summer landscapes. By investing in Pinnacle Niseko, you\u2019re not only securing a prime piece of real estate but also becoming part of a vibrant and growing community.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A Unique Opportunity in Niseko\u2019s Real Estate Market</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">As one of Hokkaido's most sought-after regions, Niseko's real estate market presents a valuable opportunity for both personal enjoyment and investment. Properties in this area often appreciate in value due to the region\u2019s year-round appeal to tourists, outdoor enthusiasts, and investors alike.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pinnacle Niseko offers potential buyers a rare chance to own a slice of this thriving community. With stunning mountain views, a peaceful setting, and proximity to world-class amenities, this property is the perfect foundation for creating a one-of-a-kind home in Japan\u2019s outdoor paradise.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Whether you're seeking an escape from the hustle and bustle of city life or a prime investment in one of Japan\u2019s most scenic locations, Pinnacle Niseko presents an unparalleled opportunity to build your dream home in Hokkaido.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
    "excerpt" : "<p>Pinnacle Niseko in Hokkaido, Japan, presents a stunning location for real estate, and our expert photography captures its breathtaking landscapes. With panoramic views of Mount Yotei and vibrant seasonal colors, this land offers the perfect backdrop for creating a visual story that showcases the property's unique appeal. Our videography highlights every natural feature, helping potential buyers envision their dream sanctuary in one of Japan's most sought-after destinations.</p>",
